# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Whitelist style: everything in this folder is data/results/tooling
# (~40 GB of imaging data lives here next to the code). Only the entries
# below are tracked; all else — CZI, TIF, results, notes, venv, extras —
# stays on disk but untracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*

# --- tracked: code + tests + workflow scripts + packaging/docs ---
!/src/
!/tests/
!/scripts/
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/pyproject.toml
!/.gitignore

# --- plans: default-ignored; a branch tracks a specific plan by negating it ---
# (add lines like `!/plans/<topic>.md` on the branch that owns the plan)
# NOTE: must ignore the CONTENTS (`plans/*`), not the directory (`/plans/`) —
# git cannot re-include files inside an excluded directory.
!/plans/
plans/*
!/plans/fix-ensemble-pinned-crops.md

# --- never track, anywhere ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

!/plans/fit-speedups.md
!/plans/fix-ensemble-pinned-crops.md
!/plans/z-range-derivation.md
!/plans/tiled-field-scan.md
# one-set vs Z(x,y)-map decision docs (tracked on this branch)
!/FIELDTEST_one_set_vs_Zmap.md
!/SUPERVISOR_one_set_vs_Zmap.md
!/FIELDTEST_results_one_set_vs_Zmap.md
